    <p class="plate-note">This is the core machine of Western occultism and it is worth understanding before
    judging it. A correspondence table is a <em>mnemonic and associative index</em>: it binds a metal, a day,
    a herb, a colour, an organ and a mood under one head so that a practitioner can hold a whole domain in
    mind at once and act coherently within it. Read as a filing system it is elegant and demonstrably useful
    for memory and for focus. Read as physics — iron <em>because</em> Mars — it has never once survived a
    test. The order uses the first reading and declines the second.</p>
  </figure>
</section>

