<section class="wrap narrow reveal">
  <div class="frame">
    <p class="kicker">WHAT SURVIVES CONTACT WITH EVIDENCE — AND WHAT DOES NOT</p>
    <div class="grid two">
      <div>
        <h3>Survives</h3>
        <ul class="biblio">
          <li><span class="sci">◆</span> <strong>Ritual changes the person performing it.</strong> Narrowed
          attention, expectancy, synchrony, distinctive memory — four measured mechanisms, no unknown forces
          required.</li>
          <li><span class="sci">◆</span> <strong>Expectancy has a biochemistry.</strong> The placebo response
          is partly endogenous opioid; naloxone blocks it. Mesmer's commission found this in 1784 without the
          vocabulary for it.</li>
          <li><span class="sci">◆</span> <strong>The art of memory works.</strong> The method of loci,
          central to Bruno and Camillo, remains the strongest mnemonic technique known. Memory champions still
          use the Renaissance magician's palace.</li>
          <li><span class="sci">◆</span> <strong>Alchemy built chemistry.</strong> Distillation, sublimation,
          the mineral acids, phosphorus, antimony pharmacology. The apparatus is the inheritance.</li>
          <li><span class="sci">◆</span> <strong>Astrology built astronomy.</strong> Centuries of careful
          positional data were recorded because somebody was paying for horoscopes.</li>
          <li><span class="hist">◆</span> <strong>Symbol work reaches what argument does not.</strong>
          Image, repetition and ceremony move people. This is why liturgy, courtrooms and coronations exist.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Does not survive</h3>
        <ul class="biblio">
          <li><span class="sci">◆ Tested, negative</span> <strong>Astrological prediction of
          personality or events.</strong> Carlson's double-blind test (<em>Nature</em>, 1985) and the
          subsequent meta-analyses: chance performance.</li>
          <li><span class="sci">◆ Tested, negative</span> <strong>Transmutation of base metal to gold by
          chemical means.</strong> Nuclear, not chemical. Achievable in an accelerator at absurd cost.</li>
          <li><span class="sci">◆ Tested, negative</span> <strong>Physical mediumship.</strong> Ectoplasm,
          slates, apports, table-tipping — exposed repeatedly, from the Fox sisters' own 1888 confession
          onwards.</li>
          <li><span class="sci">◆ Contested</span> <strong>Ganzfeld telepathy.</strong> Small positive
          meta-analytic effects that do not cleanly replicate under pre-registration. We record it as open and
          unproven, not as proof.</li>
          <li><span class="sci">◆ Tested, negative</span> <strong>Dowsing under blinded conditions.</strong>
          The Kassel trials, 1990: no better than chance, and the dowsers were sincere.</li>
          <li><span class="sci">◆ Tested, negative</span> <strong>Ancient unbroken lineages.</strong>
          Hermetic Egypt, Wiccan continuity, Druidic survival. The documents say otherwise.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

