    <div class="creed-glyph">{% glyph "eye" %}</div>
    <p class="creed-line">The hidden is not the forbidden. It is only what has not yet been read carefully.</p>
    <p>EGregoRA's position on the occult is one sentence long: <strong>we take the practices seriously and
    the claims literally, and we do not confuse the two.</strong> A tradition that needs a false date to be
    worth doing was never worth doing. One that can be dated to 1888, stripped of its invented pedigree, and
    still changes the person who practises it — that is a real thing, and it is the thing we study. Everything
    else on this site works the same way.</p>
